{
  "week": 8,
  "title": "Unsupervised and Association Learning",
  "topicSummary": "K-means, hierarchical clustering, PCA, dimensionality reduction, Apriori algorithm, Frequent pattern mining etc., Case studies.",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "1. Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This module focuses on learning patterns without labeled data and discovering hidden structures and relationships."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Objective:</strong> Group similar data (clustering), reduce complexity (dimensionality reduction), and discover patterns (association rules)."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "2. Unsupervised Learning"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Unsupervised learning works on unlabeled data (no predefined output). The model finds patterns automatically."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Key Tasks:</strong> Clustering, Dimensionality reduction."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "3. K-Means Clustering"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> K-Means groups data into K clusters based on similarity."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Working Steps:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "ordered",
      "items": [
        "Choose number of clusters (K)",
        "Initialize centroids",
        "Assign points to nearest centroid",
        "Update centroids",
        "Repeat until convergence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Objective Function:</strong> Σ Σ ||x - μi||²"
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Applications/Limitations:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Applications:</strong> Grouping city zones, Identifying traffic patterns, Market segmentation.",
        "<strong>Limitations:</strong> Need to choose K, sensitive to initial centroids."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "4. Hierarchical Clustering"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Builds a tree-like structure (dendrogram) of clusters."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Types:</strong> Agglomerative (bottom-up), Divisive (top-down)."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Advantages/Limitations:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Advantages:</strong> No need to predefine K, Visual representation (dendrogram).",
        "<strong>Limitations:</strong> Computationally expensive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "5. Dimensionality Reduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Reducing the number of features while preserving important information."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Why Needed?</strong> High-dimensional data is complex, improves performance and visualization."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "6. Principal Component Analysis (PCA)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> PCA transforms data into new variables (principal components) capturing maximum variance."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Key Idea:</strong> Reduce dimensions while retaining most important information. <code>Z = XW</code>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Example:</strong> Reduce 10 variables → 2 principal components."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "7. Association Learning"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Find relationships between variables in large datasets."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Example:</strong> If high traffic + rain → high accident probability."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "8. Apriori Algorithm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> An algorithm used to find frequent itemsets and generate association rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Key Metrics:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Support:</strong> Support(A) = (Transactions containing A) / (Total transactions)",
        "<strong>Confidence:</strong> Confidence(A⇒B) = Support(A∪B) / Support(A)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Steps:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "ordered",
      "items": [
        "Identify frequent itemsets",
        "Generate association rules",
        "Filter using support & confidence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "9. Frequent Pattern Mining"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Finding patterns that occur frequently in datasets (e.g., peak traffic hours, frequent accident zones)."
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "10. Case Studies (Urban Applications)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Traffic Patterns:</strong> K-Means grouping of roads.",
        "<strong>Urban Zone Classification:</strong> Hierarchical clustering of residential/commercial zones.",
        "<strong>Accident Pattern Analysis:</strong> Apriori rules linking weather and traffic.",
        "<strong>Pollution Data Reduction:</strong> PCA to reduce variables for analysis."
      ]
    },
    {
